Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm: quiesce firmware DSI and gate panel illumination

On SOFEF03F, stop the inherited host before SM8150 boot CTL cleanup
and PHY configuration. Defer backlight/followers until DPU pixel TX
completion, and reset readiness on disable. This is based on kernel154
including its probe GPIO and host timing fixes.

---

